  "Negative concord: after niekada the verb takes ne- (nebaigi).": "Dvigubas neiginys: po niekada veiksmažodis gauna ne- (nebaigi).",
  "“of”: the genitive tylos carries it.": "„of“ perteikia kilmininkas tylos.",
